DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening where we learn what it takes to plant s
 omething that outlives you\, and the courage it takes to keep it alive!\n\
 nTwo films. One question: what do we carry forward\, and what does it take
  to keep the fight going?\n\nFor the next installment in our Impact Speake
